+    description=(
+        "PrimTS DSV4 sparse MLA decode with the fused inverse-RoPE + "
+        "grouped E4M3 output epilogue: O is [16, T, 8, 512] E4M3 with one FP32 "
+        "dequant scale per contiguous D128 block in [16, 32, pad4(T)]."
